Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.50,0:22:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"Kanemoto" - KIYOBUMI KANEKO\N"Komichi" - UNO SHOHEI\N"Koucchan" - YOSHIMI YUKIHIRO
